# Research evidence and workflow

Applies throughout this repository. Follow AGENTS.md and docs/DOCUMENTATION_POLICY.md.

- Work directly on main unless the user changes this preference.
- Include documentation with every substantive change.
- Keep status, roadmap and evidence log accurate.
- Separate proposed work, executed checks, proven statements and unresolved questions.
- Record exact experimental revisions/configuration, commands, outputs and limitations.
- Preserve source attribution, counterexamples and issue history.
